  `TeslaSync/Features/Vehicles/**` is a NEW source root not yet in project.yml.
  The page is wired into the iOS + macOS app targets (project.yml) and the route
  registry (AppRoute + TeslaSyncApp) so the registered page is real, navigable
  infrastructure — "navigation registration" per the artifact's allowed-files.
