  the four web hooks through an injected `DigitalTwinPageSource` seam (P1/S8); the
  production binding maps `VehiclesStore` / `VehicleAccessStore` / `ChargingStore`
  via `StateHolderModel<LoadableState<…>>` at `AppContainer.bootstrap`. The page
  reuses the already-shipped, unit-tested twin value types + illustration
  (DigitalTwinWidget.{Models,Builder,Twin} — P4/0036), so the projection logic is
  identical to the web `lib/vehicleState.ts` on both platforms.

